# Output
output/
exports/
reports/

# App-specific runtime state — add one block per app that generates local-only files,
# with a comment explaining why (generated at runtime, not meant to be committed).
# Example:
# apps/<app-1>/runs/

# apps/simulator: the GUI-settings XML embeds computed network coordinates, so it's
# regenerated on demand (MVP-003), not committed. The background image itself
# (apps/simulator/data/context-background.png) is a static, committed asset, not
# regenerated — not gitignored. (Route/.sumocfg/edge-weight files were generated before
# MVP-005 replaced pre-generated traffic with the live TraCI engine; nothing produces them
# any more, so their ignore entries were removed.)
apps/simulator/data/*-guisettings.xml

